@startuml
title Campaign State Diagram

state "Idle" as Idle
Idle : entry / No campaign started

state "Campaign Started" as CampaignStarted
CampaignStarted : entry / Manager and staff assigned
CampaignStarted : do / Start campaign preparation

state "Preparation Complete" as PreparationComplete
PreparationComplete : entry / Everything approved and contract signed
PreparationComplete : do / Activate campaign

state "Adverts Prepared" as AdvertsPrepared
AdvertsPrepared : entry / Preparing adverts during the campaign
AdvertsPrepared : do / Approve and schedule adverts

state "Adverts Running" as AdvertsRunning
AdvertsRunning : entry / Run adverts
AdvertsRunning : do / Allow extension or adjustment of the campaign

state "Campaign Complete" as CampaignComplete
CampaignComplete : entry / All adverts finished
CampaignComplete : do / Prepare final statement

state "Payment Pending" as PaymentPending
PaymentPending : entry / Handle payment after campaign completion
PaymentPending : do / Generate refund if amount paid is less than required

state "Balance Settled" as BalanceSettled
BalanceSettled : entry / Wait for correct balance to be settled
BalanceSettled : do / Mark campaign as paid once full amount is properly paid

state "Campaign Paid" as CampaignPaid
CampaignPaid : entry / Campaign marked as paid
CampaignPaid : do / Archive the campaign and release staff and managers

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> CampaignStarted : Manager and staff assigned
CampaignStarted --> PreparationComplete : Everything approved and contract signed
PreparationComplete --> AdvertsPrepared : Activate campaign
AdvertsPrepared --> AdvertsRunning : Preparing adverts during the campaign
AdvertsRunning --> CampaignComplete : All adverts finished
CampaignComplete --> PaymentPending : Handle payment after campaign completion

PaymentPending --> BalanceSettled : Wait for correct balance to be settled
BalanceSettled --> CampaignPaid : Mark campaign as paid once full amount is properly paid
CampaignPaid --> Idle : Archive the campaign and release staff and managers

@enduml
